NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT licence covers the GRAINLINE Free edition contained in this
distribution: the geometry engine, the DXF and SVG importers, the rectangular
guillotine nesting engine, the exporters, the command-line interface and the
local web interface.

The GRAINLINE Premium and Pro modules -- irregular (no-fit polygon) nesting,
the remnant ledger, cut-path sequencing, multi-machine scheduling, costed
quoting and the REST API -- are NOT part of this distribution and are NOT
covered by this licence. They are distributed separately under a commercial
licence. See https://github.com/manijose1919/grainline for details.
